    {
      "text": "God did tempt Abraham, Gen. 22:1. Moses said … wherefore do ye tempt the Lord, Ex. 17:2. have tempted me now these ten times, Num. 14:22. Ye shall not tempt the Lord, Deut. 6:16 (Matt. 4:7; Luke 4:12). they tempted God in their heart, Ps. 78:18. they tempted … the most high God, Ps. 78:56. When your fathers tempted me, Ps. 95:9 (Heb. 3:9). tempted God in the desert, Ps. 106:14. neither will I tempt the Lord, Isa. 7:12 (2 Ne. 17:12).",
