    {
      "text": "Satan came tempting him, Moses 1:12. Satan tempted me because of my brother’s flocks, Moses 5:38. Satan … tempteth them to worship him, Moses 6:49. telling me that Satan would try to tempt me, JS—H 1:46.",
      "references": [
        {
